  "kind": "scene",
  "type": "cutscene",
  "name": "Items won",
  "notes": "Opens after every victory screen (classic and waves, any monster, even a run won before): YOU WON 3 ITEMS! over the meadow sky, with the 3 items the win gave (prize_1-3, rolled by the victory screen: 3 different of the 5 floor items), each bobbing and twinkling as on the ground, with its name and its boost, and a chime for each. They boost the next run, whatever its monster and mode: when it starts they are used up and their boosts last that whole run (see prop_picker). Winning again gives 3 new ones; they never add up. The victory song keeps playing. START goes on to the shiny screen when the win made a monster shiny (new_shiny is 0 or more), otherwise back to the menu.",
